	// The raised ceiling applies to the retried checkpoint ONLY. If it leaked
	// into selfImposedBudget it would stay raised for every later checkpoint
	// and branch, so packs the pre-flight still plans against the small budget
	// would upload in full instead of aborting — silently undoing the bound on
	// wasted upload that justifies keeping the batching budget small.
